{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はある番組の収録を\nしてきました(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビのお仕事ってやっぱり\nものすごく好きです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレッシャーで基本的には\n収録日が近くなると\nいつも震え上がっていますが\nそれと同じくらい楽しさがあるし\n自分がイキイキしているのを\n心から感じます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからももっと頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/08/04/1906785/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルのフェチ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔からにおいフェチだけど\n最近加速してますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言っても変わった香りとかよりは\nいい香りの方のフェチだよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘すぎる香りは\nそんなに得意じゃないので\n(とか言って握手会のハンドクリームは\nそこそこ甘めな気もしますが笑)\n自分で使ってる歴代の香水たちは\nお花とかムスクとか爽やかなのとか\nそっち系が多めです(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方にお仕事で行くときは\nお気に入りの柔軟剤を\n多めに入れて洗った\nパーカーとかタオルとか\n何かしらを持って行っちゃう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着く香りってあるよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ♪今日はおにゅーの香水買いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の若い子もおにゅーって言葉\n使うのかな？使わないか...ヾ(｡><)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/08/04/1906785/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BUBKAにて(*^^*)発売中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/08/04/1906785/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ユルめの生地が気持ちいい\nＴシャツにハマり中☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いたらもう8月！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いたらあとちょっとで\n23歳ですヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと余裕と決断力のある人になりたいなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は直したいところがありすぎで\n考えるとキリがないのですが今\n考えてしまうとずどぉーーんとなるので\nとりあえず23歳になるまでは\n考えないことにします。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花奈と"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/08/04/1906785/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埋まってみたヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この人ももうすぐ誕生日♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は乃木坂の2nd写真集\n1時間遅れのI love you.の\n発売日！ということで\nお渡し会もあります(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グアムに行ったのが遠い昔のようです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また海外に行きたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん是非お手に取って\nご覧くださいヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎8/5  24:30～ 日本テレビ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バズリズム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トークも歌収録も\nさせていただきました(｡･ω･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予告に出てましたが必殺技も...♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎8/6  19:54～ テレビ東京"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家、ついて行ってイイですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出演させていただきます♪\n2度目呼んでいただけて\n嬉しかったです(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もある方の家に\nお邪魔しての収録！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりなことも起こり、\n楽しい収録でした(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日だからお見逃しなく～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、\nまだどこにも披露してませんが\n裸足でSummerの替え歌で\n飛鳥でSummerって歌を作ったの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝手にヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本人にもまだ少ししか聞かせてないから\nどこかで歌いたいな～(∩^ω^∩)♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サビだけなんだけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこで歌おっかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/08/04/1906785/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではおやすみっ♡"}],"source":"archive"}